<title>FINLAND: Finnish Jan industrial production up 7.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnish Jan industrial production up 7.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial production adjusted for working days increased 7.6 percent year-on-year in January compared to a 8.8 percent rise in December, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>		   Jan 1997   Dec 1996   Jan 1996</p>
<p>		   +7.6 pct    +8.8 pct   +0.7 pct</p>
<p>Four economists' average forecast was for a growth rate of 9.8 percent (range 9.0-11.5 pct).</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358-0-680 50 235, news@reuters@.fi</p>
</text>
